  "name": null,
  "problem": "",
  "worked_solution": "First, let's recall the power rule for logarithms:\n\n$$\n{log}_{n}⁡({c}^{m})=m{log}_{n}⁡(c)\n$$\n\nUsing the power rule for logarithms and the information given, we get:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{log}_{z}⁡(512) & ={log}_{z}⁡({8}^{3}) \\\\  & =3\\cdot {log}_{z}⁡(8) \\\\  & =3\\cdot 0.3 \\\\  & =0.9\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
